    "title": "One man is dead following a pursuit ending in a crash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "8 hours ago WAGONER COUNTY, Okla. — One person is deceased following an accident on U.S. Highway 69.\nAccording to Oklahoma Highway Patrol, a trooper was pursuing 44-year-old Charles Smith, who was driving north on Highway 69.\nSmith drove into traffic in a construction area, veered to the right, and tried to drive on a construction service road.\nOHP said Smith crashed into an embankment resulting in his car flipping once. Smith passed away as a result of the crash.\nThis is still an ongoing investigation and OHP said they have notified Smith’s next of kin.",
